WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.060
Unzip it, turn on Developer mode, and load the wisebird folder.

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.032
Then pin it to the toolbar.

3
00:00:06.032 --> 00:00:11.916
Pick a provider, paste your API key. Gemini is one example; other providers have their own sites.

4
00:00:11.916 --> 00:00:15.616
Add your status. Keep the visa box ticked if you need sponsorship.

5
00:00:15.616 --> 00:00:19.964
These three are optional: start date, experience tolerance, expected pay.

6
00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:22.824
Paste your résumé. It saves automatically.

7
00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:25.374
Now open a posting and click the icon.
